# TZ/locale: use shared.env (see documents/SHARED-RESOURCES.md)
#
# Optional: host UDP port for STUN (default 3478). Change if 3478 is already in use.
# NETBIRD_STUN_HOST_PORT=3478
#
# Optional: absolute path to config.yaml for Portainer / hosts without compose cwd (default ./config.yaml).
# NETBIRD_CONFIG_PATH=/home/youruser/.config/netbird/config.yaml
